        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 italic">
          Well water is often harder than city water and usually carries iron and sediment too. The right softener is sized to your test, matched to your iron level and protected by a pre-filter. This guide explains all three, then ranks seven real softeners.
