            Test your well, then size the softener to compensated hardness and run it behind a sediment pre-filter. For most wells with hard water and some clear-water iron, the DuraWater Fleck 5600SXT Iron Blaster is the best all-round choice; choose the Aquasure Harmony iron model if your iron reading is higher.
          </p>
